{
  "title": "sekans_meydan_atesi",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:aydogdu",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Aydoğdu",
      "text": "Heave more timber on the blaze, lads; tonight the frost will descend from the peaks. Did you hear the cracking echoes along the defile?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:ayse",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Ayşe Bacı",
      "text": "We heard them, Sergeant Aydogdu... That was no wolf howl; that was the clatter of shod war horses. Let not the sentries leave the battlements empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_guven",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(1050.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Fear not; our sentries atop the towers are alert, and the ramparts of our settlement are staunch."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_dagil",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(1050.0, 90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Let all folk withdraw to their tents and cottages; do not assemble in the square and breed alarm."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_guven",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Aydoğdu",
      "text": "Keep no anxiety in your heart, gatekeeper; if need arises, we too will seize pickaxes and stand beside the portal."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_guven",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1750.0, -90.0)",
      "description": "Dayanışma Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_dagil",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, 90.0)",
      "character": "Ayşe Bacı",
      "text": "As you say, gatekeeper; yet remember that unity gathers strength when folk stand together."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:end",
      "type": "END",
      "position": "(2100.0, 0.0)"
    }
  ],
